            "value": "Ogni spesa sotto controllo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every deadline in your plan is counted backwards from %@ — so you always know what needs to happen this week.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jede Frist in eurem Plan wird ab %@ rückwärts gerechnet — so wisst ihr immer, was diese Woche dran ist."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada fecha límite de vuestro plan se cuenta hacia atrás desde %@, así siempre sabéis qué toca esta semana."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque échéance de votre plan est calculée à rebours à partir du %@ — vous savez toujours ce qui doit avancer cette semaine."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@: ogni scadenza del vostro piano è calcolata a ritroso da qui, così sapete sempre cosa deve succedere questa settimana."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every decision brings you closer to forever": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jede Entscheidung bringt euch dem Für-immer näher"
