    "Premium breaks down RSVPs, meals and groups at a glance.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Premium zeigt Zusagen, Menüwünsche und Gruppen auf einen Blick."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Premium desglosa confirmaciones, menús y grupos de un vistazo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Premium détaille réponses, menus et groupes en un coup d'œil."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Premium mostra conferme, menù e gruppi a colpo d'occhio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Premium features require a subscription. Subscriptions are automatically renewable unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You may cancel your subscription at any time through your App Store account settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Premium-Funktionen erfordern ein Abo. Abos verlängern sich automatisch, sofern nicht mind. 24 Stunden vor Periodenende gekündigt wird. Du kannst jederzeit über deine App-Store-Einstellungen kündigen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las funciones premium requieren suscripción. Se renueva automáticamente salvo cancelación 24 h antes del fin del periodo. Puedes cancelar en los ajustes de App Store."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les fonctions premium nécessitent un abonnement. Il se renouvelle automatiquement sauf annulation 24 h avant la fin de la période. Vous pouvez annuler via les réglages de l'App Store."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le funzioni premium richiedono un abbonamento. Si rinnova automaticamente salvo disdetta 24 ore prima della fine del periodo. Puoi annullare dalle impostazioni dell'App Store."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Premium lets you add anything your wedding needs to the checklist — and check off every task on it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mit Premium fügst du der Checkliste alles hinzu, was eure Hochzeit braucht – und hakst jede Aufgabe ab."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Con Premium añades a la lista todo lo que necesita vuestra boda y marcas cada tarea."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec Premium, ajoutez à la checklist tout ce dont votre mariage a besoin — et cochez chaque tâche."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Con Premium aggiungi alla checklist tutto ciò che serve al vostro matrimonio e spunti ogni attività."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Premium lets you export your guests and vendors whenever you need them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mit Premium exportierst du Gäste und Dienstleister, wann immer du sie brauchst."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Con Premium exportas invitados y proveedores cuando los necesites."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec Premium, exportez invités et prestataires dès que vous en avez besoin."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Con Premium esporti invitati e fornitori quando ti servono."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Premium opens every budget category, so each part of your wedding has its own place to live.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Premium öffnet alle Budget-Kategorien – so hat jeder Teil eurer Hochzeit seinen festen Platz."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Premium abre todas las categorías del presupuesto para que cada parte de la boda tenga su sitio."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Premium ouvre toutes les catégories de budget : chaque partie du mariage a sa place."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Premium apre tutte le categorie di budget, così ogni parte del matrimonio ha il suo posto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Premium turns your plan into a beautiful PDF you can hand to anyone who needs it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Premium macht aus eurem Plan ein schönes PDF, das du jedem in die Hand geben kannst."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Premium convierte vuestro plan en un PDF precioso que puedes dar a quien lo necesite."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Premium transforme votre planning en un beau PDF à remettre à qui en a besoin."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Premium trasforma il vostro piano in un bel PDF da consegnare a chi serve."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Premium turns your spending into clear insights — before a surprise does it for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Premium macht aus euren Ausgaben klare Einblicke – bevor es eine Überraschung tut."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Premium convierte tus gastos en datos claros, antes de que lo haga una sorpresa."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Premium transforme vos dépenses en analyses claires — avant qu'une surprise s'en charge."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Premium trasforma le spese in dati chiari, prima che lo faccia una sorpresa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
