            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La più importante"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The free plan holds 10 guests. Premium keeps every single name — with RSVPs, meals and groups.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der kostenlose Plan fasst 10 Gäste. Mit Premium hat jeder einzelne Name Platz – inklusive Zusagen, Menüwünschen und Gruppen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El plan gratuito admite 10 invitados. Con Premium cabe cada nombre: confirmaciones, menús y grupos incluidos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le plan gratuit contient 10 invités. Avec Premium, chaque nom a sa place — réponses, menus et groupes compris."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il piano gratuito contiene 10 invitati. Con Premium c'è posto per ogni nome: conferme, menù e gruppi inclusi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The free plan holds 10 photos. Premium keeps every idea you fall in love with.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der kostenlose Plan fasst 10 Fotos. Premium bewahrt jede Idee, in die du dich verliebst."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El plan gratuito guarda 10 fotos. Premium guarda cada idea de la que te enamores."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le plan gratuit contient 10 photos. Premium garde chaque idée dont vous tombez amoureux."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il piano gratuito contiene 10 foto. Premium conserva ogni idea di cui ti innamori."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The free plan lets you tick off your first 5 tasks. Premium unlocks the whole checklist, so nothing gets left behind.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Im kostenlosen Plan hakst du die ersten 5 Aufgaben ab. Premium schaltet die komplette Checkliste frei – damit nichts liegen bleibt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El plan gratuito te deja marcar las primeras 5 tareas. Premium desbloquea la lista entera para que no se quede nada."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le plan gratuit permet de cocher vos 5 premières tâches. Premium débloque toute la checklist, pour ne rien oublier."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il piano gratuito ti fa spuntare le prime 5 attività. Premium sblocca l'intera checklist, così non resta indietro nulla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The free plan tracks 3 vendors. Premium tracks your whole dream team, contracts and payments included.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der kostenlose Plan verwaltet 3 Dienstleister. Premium verwaltet euer ganzes Dreamteam – mit Verträgen und Zahlungen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El plan gratuito gestiona 3 proveedores. Premium gestiona todo tu equipo soñado, con contratos y pagos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le plan gratuit suit 3 prestataires. Premium suit toute votre dream team, contrats et paiements compris."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
