            "value": "Nous n'avons pas encore de date"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Non abbiamo ancora una data"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your personal information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir treffen geeignete technische und organisatorische Maßnahmen, um deine Daten vor unbefugtem Zugriff, Änderung, Offenlegung oder Zerstörung zu schützen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aplicamos medidas técnicas y organizativas adecuadas para proteger tus datos frente a accesos, alteraciones o divulgaciones no autorizadas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nous appliquons des mesures techniques et organisationnelles appropriées pour protéger vos données contre tout accès, modification ou divulgation non autorisés."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adottiamo misure tecniche e organizzative adeguate per proteggere i tuoi dati da accessi, modifiche o divulgazioni non autorizzati."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We use the information we collect to provide, maintain, and improve our services, process transactions, send you technical notices and support messages, and communicate with you about products, services, and events.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir nutzen deine Daten, um unsere Dienste bereitzustellen, zu verbessern, Transaktionen abzuwickeln, technische Hinweise und Support zu senden und über Produkte und Angebote zu informieren."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usamos la información para prestar y mejorar el servicio, procesar transacciones, enviarte avisos técnicos y soporte, y comunicarte sobre productos y eventos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nous utilisons ces données pour fournir et améliorer nos services, traiter les transactions, envoyer des avis techniques et du support, et communiquer sur les produits et événements."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usiamo le informazioni per fornire e migliorare i servizi, gestire le transazioni, inviarti avvisi tecnici e assistenza e comunicare su prodotti ed eventi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We use tracking only to personalize your planning and keep this app free. You decide on the next screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir nutzen Tracking nur, um deine Planung zu personalisieren und die App kostenlos zu halten. Auf dem nächsten Bildschirm entscheidest du."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usamos el seguimiento solo para personalizar tu planificación y mantener la app gratuita. Tú decides en la siguiente pantalla."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nous utilisons le suivi uniquement pour personnaliser votre organisation et garder l’app gratuite. Vous décidez à l’écran suivant."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usiamo il tracciamento solo per personalizzare la tua pianificazione e mantenere l’app gratuita. Decidi tu nella schermata successiva."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We want you to try Blissful for free.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir möchten, dass du Blissful kostenlos testest."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Queremos que pruebes Blissful gratis."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nous voulons que vous essayiez Blissful gratuitement."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vogliamo che tu provi Blissful gratis."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll nudge you before something is due — and once before any free trial ends. %lld days is not as long as it sounds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir melden uns, bevor etwas fällig ist — und einmal, bevor eine kostenlose Testphase endet. %lld Tage sind kürzer, als sie klingen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os avisaremos antes de que algo venza y una vez antes de que acabe cualquier prueba gratuita. %lld días pasan más rápido de lo que parece."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nous vous préviendrons avant chaque échéance — et une fois avant la fin de tout essai gratuit. %lld jours, c'est plus court qu'il n'y paraît."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vi avviseremo prima di ogni scadenza e una volta prima che finisca la prova gratuita. %lld giorni passano più in fretta di quanto sembri."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll nudge you before something is due — and once before any free trial ends. Nothing noisy, nothing daily.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir melden uns, bevor etwas fällig ist — und einmal, bevor eine kostenlose Testphase endet. Nichts Lautes, nichts Tägliches."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os avisaremos antes de que algo venza y una vez antes de que acabe cualquier prueba gratuita. Nada ruidoso, nada diario."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nous vous préviendrons avant chaque échéance — et une fois avant la fin de tout essai gratuit. Rien d'envahissant, rien de quotidien."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vi avviseremo prima di ogni scadenza e una volta prima che finisca la prova gratuita. Niente rumore, niente notifiche ogni giorno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll plan for about a year out": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir planen mit rund einem Jahr Vorlauf"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Planificaremos con un año de margen"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nous partons sur environ un an"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pianificheremo su circa un anno"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll plan this together, one week at a time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir planen das zusammen, Woche für Woche."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo organizaremos juntos, semana a semana."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nous organiserons tout ensemble, semaine après semaine."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Organizzeremo tutto insieme, una settimana alla volta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll split it across the 12 categories a wedding actually has.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir teilen es auf die 12 Kategorien auf, die eine Hochzeit wirklich hat."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo repartiremos entre las 12 categorías que tiene una boda de verdad."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nous le répartirons entre les 12 catégories qu'un mariage comporte réellement."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo divideremo tra le 12 categorie che un matrimonio ha davvero."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll split it across the twelve categories a wedding really has, then track every quote and payment against it — so you always know what's left.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir teilen es auf die zwölf Kategorien auf, die eine Hochzeit wirklich hat, und verfolgen jedes Angebot und jede Zahlung — so wisst ihr immer, was übrig ist."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo repartiremos entre las doce categorías que tiene una boda de verdad y controlaremos cada presupuesto y cada pago, para que siempre sepáis cuánto os queda."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nous le répartissons entre les douze catégories qu'un mariage comporte vraiment, puis nous suivons chaque devis et chaque paiement — vous savez toujours ce qu'il vous reste."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo divideremo tra le dodici categorie che un matrimonio ha davvero, poi terremo traccia di ogni preventivo e pagamento: così saprete sempre quanto vi resta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll tell you before the trial ends, so nothing is a surprise.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir sagen euch Bescheid, bevor die Testphase endet — keine Überraschungen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os avisaremos antes de que acabe la prueba, para que nada os pille por sorpresa."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nous vous préviendrons avant la fin de l'essai, aucune surprise."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vi avviseremo prima che la prova finisca, così niente sorprese."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll use your names across your plan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir nutzen eure Namen im ganzen Plan."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usaremos vuestros nombres en todo el plan."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos prénoms apparaîtront dans tout votre plan."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Useremo i vostri nomi in tutto il piano."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We're a small team trying to grow and help more couples plan their perfect day.\n\nWould you mind leaving us a quick review?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir sind ein kleines Team und möchten mehr Paaren bei ihrem perfekten Tag helfen.\n\nWürdest du uns kurz bewerten?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Somos un equipo pequeño que quiere ayudar a más parejas con su día perfecto.\n\n¿Nos dejas una reseña rápida?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nous sommes une petite équipe qui veut aider plus de couples à réussir leur grand jour.\n\nLaisseriez-vous un avis rapide ?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Siamo un piccolo team che vuole aiutare più coppie nel loro giorno perfetto.\n\nCi lasci una breve recensione?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We're here to make your planning journey stress-free": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir machen deine Planung stressfrei"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estamos para que planificar sea sin estrés"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nous rendons votre planification sans stress"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rendiamo la tua pianificazione senza stress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We're in this together": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir machen das zusammen"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estamos juntos en esto"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On fait ça à deux"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ci siamo dentro insieme"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We've got that part": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das übernehmen wir"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De eso nos encargamos nosotros"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On s'occupe de cette partie"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A questo pensiamo noi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Website": {},
    "Wedding Day Schedule": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ablauf des Hochzeitstags"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cronograma del día"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Déroulé du jour J"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Programma del giorno"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wedding Planner is a mobile application that helps users plan and organize their wedding events. The app provides tools for vendor management, budget tracking, timeline creation, and other wedding-related planning features.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wedding Planner ist eine App, die bei der Planung und Organisation der Hochzeit hilft. Sie bietet Tools für Dienstleister, Budget, Zeitplan und weitere Planungsfunktionen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wedding Planner es una app que ayuda a planificar y organizar la boda. Ofrece herramientas para proveedores, presupuesto, cronograma y más."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wedding Planner est une app qui aide à planifier et organiser le mariage. Elle propose des outils pour les prestataires, le budget, le programme et plus."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wedding Planner è un'app che aiuta a pianificare e organizzare il matrimonio. Offre strumenti per fornitori, budget, programma e altro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wedding Timeline": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hochzeits-Zeitplan"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cronograma de la boda"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Programme du mariage"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Programma del matrimonio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weekly": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wöchentlich"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Semanal"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hebdomadaire"
